/target

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. `facet setup` generates these; they must never be committed.
#
#   facet.toml   argon2 password hash, TOTP secret, JWT signing key
#   certs/       TLS private key
#   *audit.log   who logged in, from which IP, and when
#
# facet.example.toml is the redacted, committable template.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
facet.toml
*.facet.toml
certs/
*.pem
*.key

*audit.log
*audit.log.*

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
deploying-facet.pdf
